<h2>The Background of Skills &mdash; the Birth of the Coding Agent</h2>
<p>Skills are not a technique that appeared out of nowhere one day. They emerged naturally on top of a foundation called the <strong>coding agent</strong>. You need that context to understand why skills work the way they do.</p>

<h3>Kinds of agents</h3>
